- [ ] Implement input validation (Zod)
- [ ] Test tenant isolation
- [ ] Scrub sensitive fields from responses

### After Completing Implementation
- [ ] **Create and run tests** - Verify feature works as expected
  - [ ] Test tenant isolation
  - [ ] Test security measures
  - [ ] Test error handling
  - [ ] Test edge cases
  - [ ] Test integration/end-to-end
  - [ ] Ensure all tests pass
- [ ] Update `development-plan.md` - Mark completed tasks as `[x]`
- [ ] Update phase status if phase is complete
- [ ] Add implementation notes if relevant
- [ ] Verify all checkboxes reflect actual progress

